{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03845","headline":"咏井 · 苏味道","name":"咏井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玲珑映玉槛，澄澈泻银牀。\n流声集孔雀，带影出羵羊。\n桐落秋蛙散，桃舒春锦芳。\n帝力终何有，机心庶此忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}